# Vercel Web Analytics Configuration Report

## Summary
Vercel Web Analytics was **already installed and configured** in this Next.js project. No changes were necessary.

## Current Configuration Status

### ✅ Package Installation
- **Package**: `@vercel/analytics` version `^1.6.1`
- **Location**: Listed in dependencies in `package.json`
- **Package Manager**: npm (package-lock.json present)

### ✅ Implementation (App Router)
- **File**: `app/layout.tsx`
- **Import**: `import { Analytics } from '@vercel/analytics/next';`
- **Component Placement**: `<Analytics />` component placed inside `<body>` tag after `{children}`

### Code Snippet from app/layout.tsx
```typescript
export default function RootLayout({
  children,
}: Readonly<{
  children: React.ReactNode;
}>) {
  return (
    <html lang="en">
      <body className={`${geistSans.variable} ${geistMono.variable} ${abrilFatface.variable} ${cabin.variable}`}>
        {children}
        <Analytics />
      </body>
    </html>
  );
}
```

